  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen robust digital solutions with a more sustainable and resilient health supply and waste management; improve coordinative decisions and investment in health services amplified by real time analytics; strengthen capacities across implementers, leaders, contributors, and decision makers to support the appropriate use and scaling up of digital health solutions.</narrative>
